  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees.",
    "Slice the ciabatta bread into 1 inch thick slices.",
    "Place the slices on a baking sheet and toast in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the toast from the oven and let it cool for 2 minutes.",
    "Spread 1 tablespoon of low fat cream cheese on each slice of toast.",
    "Top the cream cheese with 1 tablespoon of strawberry jam.",
    "Arrange the sashimi cut cucumber and carrots on top of the jam.",
    "Drizzle 1 tablespoon of honey over the top of each slice.",
    "Sprinkle the chopped fresh dill, salt, and black pepper over the top of each slice."
  ],
